3,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I hate the smell in August. We need to know what the daily life feels like, not just the cost.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree, but I worry about the money. Who pays for the new shelter? We need to check the ledger.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Money is easy to fix. Trust is hard. Let’s look at the complaint log to see where we broke.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I’m tired of being the default manager. I need to know the actual hours this will eat from my week.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I need to know the physical footprint. If one house bears the bulk of the space, it’s not fair.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, if we spend more, does the smell go away? I want to know the sensory impact of each option.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, not necessarily. But if we don’t know the baseline cost, we can’t judge if a premium is worth it.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, space is a proxy for power. If one house dominates the layout, the others feel subservient. That’s the real issue.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, power is fine if it’s paid for. I just want to avoid the unpaid labor trap. I need to see the time commitment.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, I agree. But I need the measurements to prove it. I will look into the frontages and the station block’s minutes.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I’m going to check the station block’s bin house. I want to see how they handle the heat and the flies.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,I’ll look at the block ledger and the ward subsidy. I need to know exactly what we are paying and what we are owed.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will check the ward complaint log and the statements from the last residents' meeting. I need to know the emotional temperature.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I’m looking into the truck arrival time and the supervised mornings. I need to know when the work actually happens.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the measurements of the five frontages and the ward filing requirements. I need to know the legal and physical constraints.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,I hope the station block has a solution that doesn’t involve me smelling garbage at 7 AM.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,I hope the ledger shows we have some breathing room. I don’t want to start a fight over a few hundred yen.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I hope the complaint log shows we can still talk to each other. I don’t want to become strangers on this lane.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I hope the schedule shows I can still have a life. I don’t want to be the one answering the phone at midnight.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I hope the measurements show a clear, defensible line. I don’t want to sign a document that is technically legal but morally bankrupt.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
